Title: Solidatus glossary
Link: https://docs.solidatus.com/solidatus-6.5/additional-resources/solidatus-glossary
Content: A Solidatus Connector is a process (written using our Connector Framework) that can extract, transform, and load information from external technology into a Solidatus Model using the Solidatus JSON-based API. A Connector can also extract information from Solidatus for reporting or transmission to another tool.

See also Connector Framework
